      "rev_n_1_5c2e40_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_1_5c2e40_1",
        "node_id": "n_1_5c2e40",
        "thought_text": "The previous approach was correct in its dynamic programming formulation, but it missed considering the possibility of preparing multiple problems on the same day. This oversight led to suboptimal solutions in some cases. To address this, we should modify the dynamic programming state to explicitly track the number of problems prepared on each day, allowing for more flexible scheduling of preparation and printing operations.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_1_5c2e40_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_39e012a901",
        "created_at": 1794532248.144229
      },
      "rev_n_2_8a18c9_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_8a18c9_1",
        "node_id": "n_2_8a18c9",
        "thought_text": "I apologize for the oversight. The previous approach of prioritizing problems with lower combined preparation and printing costs is not optimal. Instead, we should consider the relative costs of preparation and printing separately, and then select the k most cost-effective problems while ensuring they are prepared before they are printed. This approach will minimize the total cost while respecting the constraints.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_2_8a18c9_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_b059481bee",
        "created_at": 1794532277.9763007
      },
      "rev_n_3_88f4f9_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_3_88f4f9_1",
        "node_id": "n_3_88f4f9",
        "thought_text": "The previous approach of selecting the k days with the lowest total cost (preparation + printing) is incorrect. It doesn't consider the constraint that problems must be prepared before they can be printed, and it may lead to suboptimal solutions. A better approach would be to use dynamic programming to find the minimum cost while respecting the preparation and printing order constraints.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_3_88f4f9_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_0a5ca7d5cd",
        "created_at": 1794532301.9658117
      },
